# Layer 4 in timestamp order (CR 613.1d, 613.7): Oko's +1 ("loses all abilities and becomes a green Elk creature with base
# power and toughness 3/3") comes after the Sanctuary's own effect, so the Elk creature it is replaces the Land Creature of
# every creature type: it is a Creature and an Elk and nothing else, green, and with no vigilance (layer 6). The Sanctuary
# is animated on turn 3 (Sol Ring, Mox Jet, a Swamp), then taps for {C} as a creature it has had since the turn began, to
# help cast Oko with Mox Emerald and Mox Sapphire.

[Bot1 Deck]
Soulstone Sanctuary
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Sol Ring
Oko, Thief of Crowns
Swamp
Swamp x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Soulstone Sanctuary.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Soulstone Sanctuary.Activate(Ability: {4})
Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Soulstone Sanctuary.Subtypes = (every creature type)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Soulstone Sanctuary.Keywords = Vigilance
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Soulstone Sanctuary.Activate(Ability: {T}: Add {C})
Bot1.Hand.Oko, Thief of Crowns.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Oko, Thief of Crowns.Activate(Soulstone Sanctuary; Ability: Elk)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Soulstone Sanctuary.Types = Creature
Bot1.Battlefield.Soulstone Sanctuary.Subtypes = Elk
Bot1.Battlefield.Soulstone Sanctuary.Colors = Green
Bot1.Battlefield.Soulstone Sanctuary.Power = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.Soulstone Sanctuary.Toughness = 3
